<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">    •  Depending on the type of input data (volume, surface or point data), cross sections will be created </span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">in</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> a different manner</span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">:</span></span>
